    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mass Matter \u2013 A Gravity-Defying Puzzle FPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fundamental Shift</strong><br>The rules you know no longer apply. In a world where gravity changes direction and walls become pathways, you must adapt to new principles. Experience gameplay that challenges the very laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/500dc791c984dc8fd9ada9a8eaa640d4.poster.avif?t=1754810810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/500dc791c984dc8fd9ada9a8eaa640d4.webm?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/500dc791c984dc8fd9ada9a8eaa640d4.mp4?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the Space</strong><br>Floors, walls, even ceilings\u2014every surface can be your foothold. Manipulate gravity to create paths, overcome obstacles, and move freely. Adjust the position, angle, and state of surfaces to craft the perfect environment for solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/178269ed6a73871ad2ff9c72c4c51b79.poster.avif?t=1754810810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/178269ed6a73871ad2ff9c72c4c51b79.webm?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/178269ed6a73871ad2ff9c72c4c51b79.mp4?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blend Your Influence</strong><br>It\u2019s not just you\u2014everything around you is affected by gravity. To solve puzzles, you must actively manipulate your surroundings. Control multiple gravitational axes, distinguish objects based on their respective influences, and combine them in creative ways to find the right solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/3c3367ec0e354eab641beb24717eef92.poster.avif?t=1754810810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/3c3367ec0e354eab641beb24717eef92.webm?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/3c3367ec0e354eab641beb24717eef92.mp4?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approach from All Angles</strong><br>There is no single way forward. Merge various gravity control techniques with creative thinking to forge new paths. Unpredictable shifts in perspective will lead you to answers you never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the Virtual World</strong><br>This is not just an experimental space. In a virtual world where reality and puzzles intertwine, seek out hidden puzzle components and restore order to the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/40a762a1d96b6923a04c05a273ed21b4.poster.avif?t=1754810810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/40a762a1d96b6923a04c05a273ed21b4.webm?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/40a762a1d96b6923a04c05a273ed21b4.mp4?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mass Matter \u2013 A Gravity-Defying Puzzle FPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fundamental Shift</strong><br>The rules you know no longer apply. In a world where gravity changes direction and walls become pathways, you must adapt to new principles. Experience gameplay that challenges the very laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/500dc791c984dc8fd9ada9a8eaa640d4.poster.avif?t=1754810810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/500dc791c984dc8fd9ada9a8eaa640d4.webm?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/500dc791c984dc8fd9ada9a8eaa640d4.mp4?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the Space</strong><br>Floors, walls, even ceilings\u2014every surface can be your foothold. Manipulate gravity to create paths, overcome obstacles, and move freely. Adjust the position, angle, and state of surfaces to craft the perfect environment for solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/178269ed6a73871ad2ff9c72c4c51b79.poster.avif?t=1754810810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/178269ed6a73871ad2ff9c72c4c51b79.webm?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/178269ed6a73871ad2ff9c72c4c51b79.mp4?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blend Your Influence</strong><br>It\u2019s not just you\u2014everything around you is affected by gravity. To solve puzzles, you must actively manipulate your surroundings. Control multiple gravitational axes, distinguish objects based on their respective influences, and combine them in creative ways to find the right solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/3c3367ec0e354eab641beb24717eef92.poster.avif?t=1754810810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/3c3367ec0e354eab641beb24717eef92.webm?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/3c3367ec0e354eab641beb24717eef92.mp4?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approach from All Angles</strong><br>There is no single way forward. Merge various gravity control techniques with creative thinking to forge new paths. Unpredictable shifts in perspective will lead you to answers you never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the Virtual World</strong><br>This is not just an experimental space. In a virtual world where reality and puzzles intertwine, seek out hidden puzzle components and restore order to the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/40a762a1d96b6923a04c05a273ed21b4.poster.avif?t=1754810810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/40a762a1d96b6923a04c05a273ed21b4.webm?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562330/extras/40a762a1d96b6923a04c05a273ed21b4.mp4?t=1754810810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
